# All game data is local-only: the public repo ships the toolkit and the
# research log, never a player's save history. A fresh clone starts with an
# empty data/ tree and the capture hub recreates the structure on first use.
data/

# The user's global gitignore excludes .claude/ everywhere; this repo
# deliberately overrides that. The advisory skill and the no-AI-trailer
# setting are part of the toolkit, not local scratch -- a fresh clone should
# get `/advise` working. Verified free of paths, tokens and personal data.
!.claude/
!.claude/**
